      "notes": "5.000.000/mo as quoted. UNCONFIRMED whether that includes administracion — in a tower with heated pool + sauna + turco, admin is often 700k-1M more. Ask.\n\nFrom the photos: big wraparound terrace with a real valley view, floor-to-ceiling sliders off the living room, proper zona de ropas (Bosch gas heater + sink), compact black-granite kitchen with gas cooktop, oven and a slatted island bar, master bath with double vanity + glass shower, second bath smaller. Interior is heavily styled: 3D geometric wallpaper on several walls, faux-stone accent wall, crystal chandeliers, mirrored wall. Not neutral — you'd be living inside someone's taste.\n\n98 m2 with a terrace that big means the indoor half is tight for 3BR+2BA. Bedrooms in the photos are modest.\n\nAmenities: heated adult + kids pool, sauna, turco, kids park + game room, sports field, walking trails, salon social.",
